    "body": "I think the idea still is to upstream most of https://w3c.github.io/DOM-Parsing/ to HTML as that defines most of the infrastructure. The DOM is rather agnostic to parsing/serialization.\r\n\r\n(There are some longer standing issues without a clear decision about whether extensions should go on Element vs HTML/SVG/MathElement, and whether partial is a good idea, but let's not block on that. 😊)",
