    "created_at": "2021-10-15T16:15:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-15T16:15:29Z",
    "body": "> The Sanitizer interface, is likely going to be adopted into W3C WebAppSec.\r\n\r\nI think that would be suboptimal, as opposed to having its graduation location be HTML. I think solid maintenance is more important than having a small standalone spec; small and standalone is reasonable for documentation, but for a spec it's best to have it co-located with other fundamental HTML infrastructure.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
