    "created_at": "2024-07-09T17:23:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-09T17:23:59Z",
    "body": "We'd like to advance this proposal to [stage 2](https://whatwg.org/stages#stage2) in the [WHATWG Stages](https://whatwg.org/stages) process.\r\n* There is a [draft specification](https://wicg.github.io/sanitizer-api/) which is being updated as the discussion evolves.\r\n* There is a WPT test suite (which is being updated to match the current spec).\r\n* At least two browser engines are doing implementation work. (Also, a previous version of the spec was fully implemented in Chrome, but meanwhile retracted as the spec had progressed.)\r\n \r\n(I don't seem to have permission to add the `agenda+` label myself. I'll ask for help with that.)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
